  "description": "<p>My father was a tailor in our small remote village, \"Kinland,\" in the 1980s. After so many years, I still remember all his moves and words. He told me he has to be extremely patient and make every detail as good as possible. His friends(people in the Kinland village) save a whole year for his entire family's garments. They pay for the clothes once a year and only start to wear them for the spring festival. So their kids will have the sweetest smile when they put on the clothes on the spring festival eve. I should take excellent care of it. Otherwise, he said the kids wouldn't be cute, smiling at me. Haha&hellip;I believe it is a seed that makes Welkinland Packs and me.- Manufacture durable bags with heart and responsibility, making all our friends &amp; customers happy and safe!</p>",
